  "facts": {
    "incoming": "hurt first rejects attackState31,32 or33 unless the source has BYPASSES_INVULNERABILITY. For all surviving calls, destroyBlocksTick<=0 writes20 BEFORE shared hurt. It then calls locked IABoss_monster.hurt with the same source and original damage and returns that boolean directly. Timer arming is not dependent on native hurt success and occurs before inherited virtual invulnerability, cap/range/bucket rejection or the shared bypass early return. State rejection occurs before arming. No local direct/causing entity filter, weapon/flying/rage/shield test, amount rewrite, phase transition or post-hurt write exists. No isInvulnerableTo or canBeAffected override is declared in Maledictus; reuse the locked parent declaration chain, native Entity/NeoForge admission and shared boss effect whitelist.",
    "invulnerability": "No concrete isInvulnerableTo/canBeAffected overrides; locked IABoss/IA/Animation parent declarations and native Entity/NeoForge/shared whitelist are reused.",
    "phase": "Live half/quarter ratios are separate from raw weapon/flying/rage and protected incoming states31-33; no saved phase/shield latch. Offense/gain/control readers/writers deferred.",
    "persistence": "Concrete RageMeter int and Tombstone_Direction byte only; transient rage/destroy/cooldown/attack/flying/weapon state not saved. Locked Home/LifeRemain retained.",
    "encounter": "Native tombstone recharge/LIT/countdown/server/home/finalize/clearance/add-success; finalize overwrites supplied FACING with SOUTH. Literal load contains type11 versus putInt retained."
  },
